ned a SEV2 incident.\n\n- **Problem:** The latest release, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in all three regions (us-east, us-west and eu-west), with an 18% error rate. Its test version (v2.3.1-rc) had also failed health checks in staging.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. All three regions now run it, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) describes the failure and the rollback, and lists finding the cause before v2.3.1 is deployed again as the next step. Opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}